 ## Difficulty Amplification
 - The `solve()` function MUST hardcode at least 3 distinct document-specific constants from
 different sections.
 - Rules MUST come from at least 2 different document topics/sections.
 - Include at least 1 edge case where a naive interpretation gives a WRONG answer.
 - Include at least 1 rule interaction that produces a counter-intuitive result.
 - At least 2 of the {test_cases_per_task} test cases should trigger edge-case behavior.
 - Constants should NOT be round numbers or common values -- use the exact values from the
 document.
